Thus begins the tale unseen:
Proclaim the text of calling gcd with 48, 18.
Proclaim the text of calling gcd with 100, 75.
Speak "Still alive".

To gcd, taking men as whole number, and lumber as whole number, giving whole number:
If the lumber is zero, then:
Give back the men.
Otherwise:
Give back calling gcd with the lumber, the remainder of the men and the lumber.
So be it.
